          "id": "1813571"
        },
        "body": "Filed the root-cause fix against the SDK: https://gitea.com/gitea/go-sdk/pulls/870\n\n`MergePullRequest` used `getStatusCode`, which discards the refusal body, so tea received `success=false, err=nil` and could only guess the reason from the PR state. Once that merges, the server's own message surfaces directly in `tea pr merge` (and gitea-cli inherits the fix as it moves merge calls onto this SDK method).\n\nThis comment was written with AI assistance (Kimi Code).\n"
      },
